{"name": "s3", "dur": 41.99, "lines": [{"id": "k01", "t0": 0.35, "t1": 1.6, "clip": 0.28, "text": "发布会上的速度翻倍，", "ch": [0.35, 0.475, 0.6, 0.725, 0.85, 0.975, 1.1, 1.225, 1.35, 1.475], "sub": null, "big": "发布会上的速度翻倍，", "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "k02", "t0": 2.0, "t1": 3.07, "clip": 1.94, "text": "到手可能打对折。", "ch": [2.0, 2.134, 2.268, 2.401, 2.535, 2.669, 2.802, 2.936], "sub": null, "big": "到手可能打对折。", "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "k03", "t0": 3.47, "t1": 8.24, "clip": 3.41, "text": "AI 芯片之间也在天天寄快递，速度动不动就翻倍。听到翻倍，先问三句。", "ch": [3.47, 3.605, 3.74, 3.875, 4.01, 4.145, 4.279, 4.414, 4.549, 4.684, 4.819, 4.954, 5.089, 5.224, 5.359, 5.494, 5.638, 5.783, 5.927, 6.072, 6.216, 6.361, 6.505, 6.65, 6.795, 6.939, 7.084, 7.228, 7.373, 7.517, 7.662, 7.806, 7.951, 8.095], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "k04", "t0": 8.69, "t1": 13.0, "clip": 8.64, "text": "第一句：在什么路上跑的？就像千兆宽带，到你卧室可能只剩一半。", "ch": [8.69, 8.817, 8.945, 9.072, 9.35, 9.469, 9.588, 9.706, 9.825, 9.944, 10.062, 10.181, 10.48, 10.617, 10.754, 10.891, 11.029, 11.166, 11.303, 11.69, 11.809, 11.928, 12.047, 12.166, 12.285, 12.405, 12.524, 12.643, 12.762, 12.881], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "k05", "t0": 13.45, "t1": 17.9, "clip": 13.4, "text": "同样写着 224G，有的能推过一米长的铜缆，有的只跑几厘米。", "ch": [13.45, 13.604, 13.758, 13.912, 14.066, 14.22, 14.374, 14.528, 14.682, 14.836, 15.11, 15.243, 15.377, 15.51, 15.643, 15.777, 15.91, 16.043, 16.177, 16.31, 16.443, 16.577, 16.83, 16.964, 17.097, 17.231, 17.365, 17.499, 17.632, 17.766], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "k06", "t0": 18.35, "t1": 25.51, "clip": 18.3, "text": "第二句：费不费电？就像手机，跑分越高，越容易烫手掉电。几万颗芯片一起跑，电费就是真金白银。", "ch": [18.35, 18.509, 18.668, 18.827, 18.986, 19.146, 19.305, 19.464, 19.623, 19.782, 19.941, 20.1, 20.259, 20.418, 20.578, 20.737, 20.896, 21.055, 21.214, 21.373, 21.532, 21.691, 21.85, 22.01, 22.169, 22.328, 22.487, 22.646, 22.805, 22.964, 23.123, 23.282, 23.442, 23.601, 23.76, 23.919, 24.078, 24.237, 24.396, 24.555, 24.714, 24.874, 25.033, 25.192, 25.351], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "k07", "t0": 25.96, "t1": 30.9, "clip": 25.91, "text": "第三句：真机测过没有？发布会上的续航，和你到手的续航，常常是两回事。", "ch": [25.96, 26.097, 26.235, 26.372, 26.65, 26.787, 26.924, 27.061, 27.199, 27.336, 27.473, 27.81, 27.93, 28.05, 28.17, 28.29, 28.41, 28.53, 28.65, 28.86, 28.977, 29.095, 29.212, 29.33, 29.447, 29.565, 29.683, 29.91, 30.051, 30.193, 30.334, 30.476, 30.617, 30.759], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "k08", "t0": 31.95, "t1": 32.7, "clip": 31.89, "text": "一句话带走：", "ch": [31.95, 32.075, 32.2, 32.325, 32.45, 32.575], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}, {"id": "k09", "t0": 32.95, "t1": 36.92, "clip": 32.89, "text": "下次看到速度翻倍，先问：什么路？费不费电？实测了吗？", "ch": [32.95, 33.087, 33.223, 33.36, 33.497, 33.633, 33.77, 33.907, 34.043, 34.4, 34.55, 34.7, 34.96, 35.087, 35.215, 35.343, 35.67, 35.776, 35.882, 35.988, 36.094, 36.37, 36.48, 36.59, 36.7, 36.81], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}, {"id": "k10", "t0": 37.17, "t1": 40.39, "clip": 37.11, "text": "下一条：信号上路以后，为什么会越跑越模糊？", "ch": [37.17, 37.323, 37.477, 37.63, 37.783, 37.937, 38.09, 38.243, 38.397, 38.55, 38.703, 38.857, 39.01, 39.163, 39.317, 39.47, 39.623, 39.777, 39.93, 40.083, 40.237], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}], "shots": [{"kind": "launch", "t0": 0, "paper": false, "first": "k01", "t1": 3.17}, {"kind": "route", "t0": 3.17, "paper": false, "first": "k03", "topic": "提速一倍，先问三句", "t1": 8.39}, {"kind": "wifi", "t0": 8.39, "paper": false, "first": "k04", "t1": 13.15}, {"kind": "cable", "t0": 13.15, "paper": false, "first": "k05", "t1": 18.05}, {"kind": "hot", "t0": 18.05, "paper": false, "first": "k06", "t1": 25.66}, {"kind": "ppt", "t0": 25.66, "paper": false, "first": "k07", "t1": 31.65}, {"kind": "take", "t0": 31.65, "paper": true, "first": "k08", "type": [{"text": "一句话带走", "line": "k08", "from": null, "to": null}, {